## Maths

$$
\sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}
$$

$$
\int_0^{\infty} e^{-x^2}\,dx = \frac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}
$$

$$
P(A \mid B) = \frac{P(B \mid A) P(A)}{P(B)}, \quad x \to \infty, \quad x \tos y, \quad W^\top x + b
$$

$$
\softmax(z)_i = \frac{e^{z_i}}{\sum_{j} e^{z_j}}, \quad \mathcal{L}_{\text{MSE}} = \frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^N (y_i - \hat{y}_i)^2
$$

$$
A = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\ 3 & 4 \end{pmatrix}, \quad f(x) = \begin{cases} x & x > 0 \\ 0 & \text{sinon} \end{cases}
$$

